{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "19d35f11-c1ca-8f17-ab06-7716cf869aa3",
  "created_at": "2025-12-23T14:58:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Miguel Pagan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:57:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing Authority, this is Walter. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:57:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi, good afternoon. Miguel Pagan here. I'm on speaker, so, uh, tell me if you can't hear me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:57:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. There's a little crackle on the line, but go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:57:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it sounds like somebody's frying bacon over here, sorry about that. So I moved last month, a new place, still in Newport, and I need to know how to get registered to vote at the new address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:57:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Since you've moved, you'll want to update your registration. You can fill out a voter registration form, and we can get one to you, or you can do it through the state's online system."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:57:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I asked at the post office and she said, just fill it out there. And then I said, well, does that go to you? And she said she wasn't sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:57:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Forms can be mailed or brought in to us, so if you filled one out at the post office, it should be fine, but I'd bring it here to be safe. [pause] Is it a paper form you have?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:58:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, I didn't take one. Okay. And what ID do I need? My buddy said, you need a utility bill, and I said, I don't think so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:58:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For registering, they'll ask for your driver's license or state ID number, or the last four digits of your Social Security number. You don't need a utility bill to register. At the polls you'd show an acceptable photo ID."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:58:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] Sorry, say that last part again? The polls?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:58:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "When you vote in person, you bring a photo ID. A license works, so does a state ID."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:58:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, license. I got that. So I fill the form, license number on it, bring it to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:58:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. We're at City Hall, and I'll note that you're coming."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:58:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That's what I needed. Thanks, Walter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:58:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Pagan. Happy holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:58:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, you too. Bye."
    }
  ],
